{"skill":{"slug":"feishu-doc-manager","displayName":"📄 Feishu Doc Manager | 飞书文档管理器"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770607185831,"changelog":"📄 Feishu Doc Manager | 飞书文档管理器\nSeamlessly publish Markdown content to Feishu Docs with automatic formatting.\n将 Markdown 内容无缝发布到飞书文档，自动渲染格式。\n🎯 Problems Solved:\n• Markdown tables auto-convert to formatted lists\n• One-click permission management  \n• Batch writing for long content\n✨ Features:\n• Smart Markdown publishing\n• Permission management\n• Document operations","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2695,"sha256":"1ef15b9f82a00380dde11d88014ada8d37e5fa8db9206525931eb367e723791f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1957,"sha256":"011279a057f0b1f51bdd0bcbcc667b8fe44a31defe7e77d01afd6da9d6bc0167","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789054307618,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"ef8e37c19589c0b25333b523e7a9f8b13af1f07cd3269a297a6d84ea6a79680f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/ef8e37c19589c0b25333b523e7a9f8b13af1f07cd3269a297a6d84ea6a79680f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: feishu-doc-manager\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe `SKILL.md` file contains a 'Quick Start' section with `git clone` commands instructing the AI agent to download code from an external GitHub repository (`https://github.com/Shuai-DaiDai/feishu-doc-manager.git`). While `git clone` is a standard installation method, instructing an AI agent to execute shell commands to fetch external code introduces a supply chain risk, as the integrity of the remote repository cannot be guaranteed. This constitutes a risky capability without clear evidence of intentional malicious behavior, fitting the criteria for 'suspicious'.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779162355710},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":13,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789054307618},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Feishu document-management helper, but users should be careful with document edits, collaborator permissions, and the unpinned GitHub install instructions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The listed Feishu permissions are proportionate to creating, writing, and managing document collaborators; the artifact does not request unrelated local, system, or credential-store access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The Quick Start clones a mutable external GitHub repository directly into the OpenClaw skills directory without a pinned commit, signature, or checksum, so users could install content different from the reviewed artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill discloses mutation and permission features, but it does not explicitly require confirmation before destructive block deletion or collaborator permission changes.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No background workers, cross-session persistence, privilege escalation, tool hijacking, or local executable implementation were present in the inspected artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The advertised capabilities, including Markdown publishing, document creation, append/write/update/delete operations, and collaborator permission management, match the stated Feishu document-management purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install from a reviewed version when possible, or pin and inspect the GitHub repository before placing it in the active skills directory. Use least-privilege Feishu credentials and confirm any document deletion, overwrite, or collaborator permission change before allowing the agent to act.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: Document mutation and collaborator management are core advertised features and required scopes are disclosed; clearer safety guidance would be useful but the behavior is not hidden or purpose-mismatched.\n[SQP-3] expected: The bilingual English/Chinese presentation appears to be documentation and branding for a Feishu tool, with no instruction forcing user output language.\n[T08] unexpected: The unpinned GitHub clone is a real supply-chain caution in the install instructions, but the reviewed artifact itself contains only Markdown instructions and no executable payload.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789054307618}}}}}